tags:['Based in UK','Remote'],
intro:'Creative UX/UI Designer and avid beekeeper based in the UK. Coming from a background in streaming and guitar teaching.',
about:'I am a UX/UI designer who believes that strategic thinking, creativity and problem solving are all key elements that create enjoyable and delightful user centred experiences. With my background in music and streaming I developed vital skills in live mediation, mentoring and motivational speaking. In addition to this, for the last 8 years I’ve been beekeeping, where patience and attention to detail have helped me build my own apiary.',
proj:[
{k:'t',go:'teach',t:'UX Design Teaching',tags:['Remote teaching','Education','4 years','Instructor'],p:'Teaching and mentoring aspiring UX designers through hands-on workshops, real-world projects and collaborative learning experiences.'},
{k:'a',go:'x',t:'Alta Flora',tags:['Mobile app · concept project','Healthtech','3 weeks','UX designer'],p:'As a team of 4 UX designers we were approached by the startup Alta Flora who help users track their medical intake and symptoms. Our solution was to incorporate an onboarding experience for the medical tracking app to help users navigate and understand the app.'},
{k:'b',go:'x',t:'Balance',tags:['Mobile app · concept project','Healthtech','2 weeks','UX designer'],p:'Working within a team of 4 UX designers we had to solve the problem of decreased user engagement for the Balance mobile app. Through deep user research we discovered that a group meditation feature would differentiate the app amongst its competitors.'}],
journey:[['Music & streaming','I learned to read a room. Live mediation, mentoring and public speaking taught me how people think, listen and react.',['Mediation','Mentoring','Speaking']],['Beekeeping','Eight years of keeping bees taught me patience, observation and attention to detail, and I built my own apiary along the way.',['Patience','Observation','Detail']],['UX/UI design','Now I bring all of it to design: listening first, then shaping simple, human experiences.',['Research','Design','Teaching']]],
process:[['Understand','I start by talking to people and digging into the problem, so I know what really needs solving before I design anything.'],['Design','I turn what I learn into wireframes and prototypes that are simple to use and easy to follow.'],['Refine','I test with real users, fix what is confusing, and keep improving until it is clear, simple and accessible.']],
tools:[['Design',['Figma','Miro']],['Build',['Webflow','Lovable']],['Collaborate',['Slack','Trello','Notion']],['AI',['ChatGPT','Claude']]],
stats:[['4 years','Teaching UX'],['14+ cohorts','Courses delivered'],['100s','Of students supported'],['Major clients','Natwest, Adobe, JP Morgan Chase']],
taught:[['General Assembly','Online · Live cohorts · Worldwide','A global tech school that has helped over two million people learn in-demand skills and launch tech careers. I taught live online UX design courses there, guiding small cohorts through hands-on, project-based learning.'],['Berghs','Stockholm · Bachelor, portfolio & online','A Stockholm school of communication, design and technology, with bachelor’s, portfolio and online programmes. I shared my UX design experience with its students.']],
did:[['What I did','Delivering practical UX skills','I taught UX design courses online, guiding students through the full design process from research and ideation to prototyping, testing and presenting. Alongside the core curriculum, I created my own Figma workshops, ran interactive exercises, provided feedback and supported students on their projects.'],['Workshops','Custom workshops and group activities','Alongside the core curriculum, I created and delivered my own Figma workshops and collaborative group activities to help students put theory into practice. These sessions encouraged students to explore ideas, share perspectives and learn from one another.'],['Support I provided','Providing support for students','I provided ongoing support through 1:1 mentoring sessions, personalised feedback and practical guidance throughout students’ projects, building their confidence and encouraging them to think critically about their design decisions.']],
learned:[['Kind, specific feedback builds confidence','Students grew fastest when feedback was personal, patient and practical. It built their confidence as much as their skills.'],['Doing beats explaining','Hands-on Figma workshops and group activities helped students put theory into practice far better than talking through it.'],['Teaching sharpens my own design','Explaining the design process step by step made me clearer about my own decisions and how I communicate them.']],
quotes:['Freddie thank u for leading us to find our own way in our work and figure things out with your gentle guidance :) thank u for all the time and care','Freddie, thank you for your time and presence and patience and your useful and fun feedback!!! I appreciate how you have accommodated us and stretched your schedule to help us!']
